  "published": "2026-08-23T04:36:43.577Z",
  "releaseNotes": "TCMProject.Utilities: adds MANAGE_ENCOUNTER_CORRECTIONS (=32, \"Gestionar correcciones de encuentro\") to PermissionEnum in TCMEnums. Grants reopening a closed medical encounter, voiding an already-signed prescription or consent (without touching the signed document itself), and adding a correction with a reason on an encounter that was reopened — actions with more weight than the normal in-encounter editing already gated by MANAGE_DIAGNOSES, since they touch artifacts that were already signed/issued (medicalhistoryapisolution #148/#149). One permission for all three, same criterion as MANAGE_CLINICAL_NOTES covering sign+addendum+error. Non-breaking, additive. Verified against the actually-published package (not just this checkout) before picking 32: 31 (APPROVE_ABSENCE_REQUESTS) is the true last value in 26.8.20.1.",
